# Per-clone hook bookkeeping (dirty.txt, commit_reminder_ack.txt,
# explained_commit.txt). Ignored as a directory rather than file by file -
# listing them individually meant a newly added state file was tracked by
# default, and explained_commit.txt was committed once that way.
